{
  "format": "plan-summary-normalization-vectors/1",
  "about": [
    "Shared grouping vectors for chant's plan summary (INTENTIUS/chant#3188) and choudoufu's live-summary (INTENTIUS/choudoufu#1753).",
    "Each repo keeps its own grouping code and runs every row in CI.",
    "rootPairs: a and b are two roots of a choudoufu live-plan-set -json document; summarize a set holding exactly the two, and they must land in one group iff group is true.",
    "instancePairs: a and b are two resource_changes of one terraform show -json plan; summarize that plan, and the two instances must land in one group iff group is true.",
    "Red first: a naive grouper (equal raw resource_changes) must fail every rootPairs row with group true, and a grouper that blanks every string value in before and after must falsely group exactly the rootPairs rows named in overEagerFalselyGroups.",
    "sensitive attribute: chant's change-set carries no value for an attribute marked in before_sensitive or after_sensitive, so two sensitive attributes group by path alone, and a sensitive attribute never groups with an unmarked one. read entry: a data source read carries no attributes, so reads of one address group whatever they returned."
  ],
